(text "DAT board: sits in the 6809/6309 socket; the CPU plugs into J1 on top. All CPU pins pass straight through." (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9954ad01-23b5-49a0-9e59-472b518f026e))
(text "U1 shadows writes to $FFA0-$FFAF (D7:D6), $FF90 (MMU enable, MC3), $FF91 (task), $FF9B (video bank), $FFD8/9 (speed)" (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5baee6ff-ca44-4d55-a986-28a281be5d98))
(text "and drives BANK1:0 = physical A20:A19 for each GIME slot. Logic: cpld/dat2m.v, pins: cpld/dat2m_top.v." (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 571aa9ea-c096-42b5-9e3a-b37235d1fb0c))
(text "CPLD IO pin numbers above carry the signals named on their labels (assignment chosen for routing)." (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d6a5f4e8-3f3a-4d8d-95d1-fc710da15a07))
(text "J2 = G, G, B, B to the memory board (R1/R2 100R protect against a reversed cable). J4 = turbo LED (+5V, cathode via R3); lit in fast mode." (at 25.40 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1359415a-ee1f-4f91-b4d0-9f9d36429469))
(text "neo-mem-compact - CC BY-SA 4.0." (at 25.40 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 85d25c03-4fee-41ef-bcbd-a54c4b4507ac))
